            "scene_context": "Jasper sits perched on the window sill of Mrs. Gable's bakery, meticulously grooming his whiskers. Outside, a perfectly manicured rose bush suddenly blooms *backwards*, its roses retracting into the buds with a soft, rustling *whoosh*. A nearby robin hops backward on the lawn, momentarily confused, before resuming its normal behavior. The golden sunlight momentarily distorts, rippling like heat rising from asphalt, before settling back into its idyllic perfection. Jasper pauses his grooming, his amber eyes fixed on the receding rose bush, a flicker of unease in their depths. A single, perfectly formed sugar cookie levitates briefly from a tray in the bakery window before gently falling back down.",
